### 4. Implementation Requirements

Please have Codex review the entire existing script before making changes.

- Fix the underlying provider integrations rather than adding isolated test-only patches.
- Keep all existing Cine-File functionality intact.
- Avoid unnecessary frontend changes.
- Do not hard-code API keys or expose credentials in logs.
- Preserve the existing database schemas and API response contracts.
- Remove obsolete temporary diagnostic functions after proper testing.
- Return the complete updated Apps Script, not just snippets.

**Definition of done:** The health checks pass, users can search and select books and restaurants, and both categories support their existing rating and wishlist workflows without provider errors. Books should continue working when Google Books is temporarily unavailable.
